  "releaseNotes": "Path handling on Windows: domain code built and split `/`-separated bundle and remote paths with `System.IO.Path`, which emits `\\` on Windows and broke 69 tests in the release build; it now uses `/`-only helpers, and a test guards against reintroducing `Path.Combine`/`GetDirectoryName`/`GetFileName` in `Eru.Domain`",
